Terax Tiling
A modified fork of Terax (https://github.com/crynta/terax-ai), licensed under
the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Modifications (2026): tuios-style tiling for terminal tabs, adapted from the
ideas of tuios (https://github.com/Gaurav-Gosain/tuios): BSP placement, a
windowed look with gaps and title bars, animations, and a Ctrl+B keyboard
layer. Files changed from upstream carry a "Modified for Terax Tiling" note.
Original copyright notices are kept.
